{"id":"53baabe271ac5d81","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/610_条件逻辑_CEM.md","title":"610 条件逻辑 CEM","display":"610_条件逻辑_CEM","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cond}\">\\(\\operatorname{cond}\\)</span>，并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span> 是满足以下五个形成子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换、结构相等\">3. 自由变元、替换、结构相等</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{610}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{610}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由变元函数定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{610}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{610}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{610}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{610}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{610}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{610}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{610}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,610}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,610}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{610}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{610}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{610}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{610}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{610}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{610}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件分配：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{610}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{610}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件排中：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow B)\\lor(A\\Rightarrow\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow B)\\lor(A\\Rightarrow\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{610}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{610}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{610}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{610}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{610}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{610}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{610}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{610}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{610}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{610}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{610}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{610}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{610}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{610}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{610}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{610}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{610}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{610}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{610}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{610}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{610}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{610}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{610}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{610}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标区分\">8. 目标区分</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"610\">\\(610\\)</span> 的特异成分是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\\)</span>：对每个前件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与后件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，条件公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow\\neg B\">\\(A\\Rightarrow\\neg B\\)</span> 之一以对象语言析取形式出现。该系统不加入 ID 或中心性。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-结构说明\">9. 结构说明</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CEM}^{610}\\)</span> 中按第 1 节展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg X\\to Y)\">\\((\\neg X\\to Y)\\)</span>，不是额外原始连接词。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CEM}_{610}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\operatorname{FV}_{610},\\operatorname{BV}_{610},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{610},\\operatorname{Sub}_{610},\\equiv_{\\alpha,610},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{610},\\mathsf{Rule}_{610},\\mathsf{Proof}_{610},\\operatorname{last}_{610},\n\\vdash_{610},\\mathsf{Thm}_{610},\\mathsf{Cert}_{610}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CEM}_{610}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\operatorname{FV}_{610},\\operatorname{BV}_{610},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{610},\\operatorname{Sub}_{610},\\equiv_{\\alpha,610},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{610},\\mathsf{Rule}_{610},\\mathsf{Proof}_{610},\\operatorname{last}_{610},\n\\vdash_{610},\\mathsf{Thm}_{610},\\mathsf{Cert}_{610}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含条件句法证明关系；不含单一最近世界语义或选择函数语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换、结构相等","text":"3. 自由变元、替换、结构相等","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标区分","text":"8. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"9.-结构说明","text":"9. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cond}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{610},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\